--
-- This matters because SupabaseSpeciesRepository.getContentInLocale deliberately has no English
-- fallback (the mother-tongue half must never quietly show a third language), so on the Supabase
-- path the dual-language secondary half rendered nothing at all for every locale but en/sv.
--
-- Regenerate with: npx tsx scripts/gen-species-seed.ts
-- Idempotent (on conflict do update), so it is safe to re-apply.

